{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114400","id":3133127982,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc66v70u","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114400","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114400.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114400.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114400","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114400/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114400/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114400/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0918da0122fe04219a5611032d46531379b06e01","number":114400,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix camera module error handling and remove unnecessary transform","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\nFixes #114399\r\n\r\nFixes several issues in the macOS camera module:\r\n\r\n**Unnecessary transform removed:**\r\n- Removed hardcoded `Transform2D(-1.0, 0.0, 0.0, -1.0, 1.0, 1.0)` in `CameraMacOS::update_feeds()` that caused incorrect rotation/mirroring on MacBooks\r\n- Unlike mobile devices, desktop cameras don't require orientation correction\r\n\r\n**Error handling improvements:**\r\n- `activate_feed()` now returns proper status instead of always returning `true`\r\n- Added early return in `MyCaptureSession initForFeed:andDevice:` when input/output device acquisition fails\r\n- Added null check for `pixelBuffer` in `captureOutput:didOutputSampleBuffer:fromConnection:`\r\n- Added error messages for `AVAuthorizationStatusDenied` and `AVAuthorizationStatusRestricted`\r\n- Added plane count check before accessing pixel buffer planes to handle unexpected buffer formats\r\n- Improved null checks with one-time logging and proper `CVPixelBuffer` unlock before returning on error\r\n\r\n**Resource lifecycle improvements:**\r\n- Added destructor `~CameraFeedMacOS()` to properly clean up the capture session when the feed is destroyed\r\n- Deactivate feeds in `update_feeds()` before removing them to prevent resource leaks\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3OD